book:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Chop|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Walnut|walnuts]] or hickory nuts\n* ½ cup chopped [[Cookbook:Apple|apples]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Beat|Beat]] sugar and egg until smooth.\n# Beat in flour, baking powder, salt, and vanilla.\n# Stir walnuts or hickory nuts and apples into the mixture.\n# Pour into a greased [[Cookbook:Dutch Oven|Dutch oven]] or 9 x 9-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] pan.\n# [[Cookbook:Bake|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|325°F (160°C)]] for 30 minutes. \n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* If you like topping, use whipped cream or ice cream.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pudding]]\n[[Category:Camping recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Apple Pudding","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¾ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"¾ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"¾ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ cup flour","sourceText":"¼ cup flour","amountText":"¼ cup flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1¼ teaspoons baking powder","sourceText":"1¼ teaspoons baking powder","amountText":"1¼ teaspoons baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"sou